# dungeon at the chapter that gear belongs to: string, gunpowder and bones from the first dungeons, blaze rods in the
# fortress, Aether gear from its dungeons' valkyries and mimics, cataclysm's black steel and ancient metal from the
# draugr and kobolds, Legendary Monsters' weapon halves from the haunted knights, Twilight's armour shards from the
# goblins, Aquamirae's fins and fangs from the fish around the ships (swimmers come in the dungeon's water). Minibosses among them (over 80 health: kobolediator, aptrgangr, the knights, the warden) come rarely.
